    {
      "id": "step-023",
      "title": "Ask Continue：Deny不解除客户端，Allow只继续指定ID；同一旧ID随后在审批前被拒绝。 / Ask Continue: Deny leaves the client suspended, Allow continues only the selected ID, and the stale ID is rejected before approval.",
