      "image": "step-023.png",
      "rawImage": "step-023.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-024",
      "title": "Ask Edit：批准后才修改method、URL与正文，真实origin只观察替换后的目标和文本。 / Ask Edit: only approval changes method, URL, and body; the real origin observes only the replacement target and text.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-024.png",
      "rawImage": "step-024.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-025",
      "title": "Auto：Drop不显示审批且不抵达origin；HTTP disable/enable决定后续真实POST是否进入pending。 / Auto: Drop shows no approval and never reaches origin; HTTP disable/enable controls whether later real POSTs become pending.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-025.png",
      "rawImage": "step-025.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-026",
      "title": "WebSocket数据面：真实连接提供exchangeId，Tool启用后frame进入同一pending列表，Continue与Disable作用于真实对端。 / WebSocket data plane: a real connection provides exchangeId; Tool enable queues a frame in the same pending list, and Continue/Disable affect the real peer.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-026.png",
      "rawImage": "step-026.png"
    },
